h results like these, why halt the offense? If we commit the rest of the Intelligent Plants, HQ's three legions would crumble.",0,""],["w",0.3],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No.==W== If we go all-in, we're the ones who lose. Know why?",1,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","OutQuad",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,0.8],["cbg",0,-150.0,null,1.3,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1],["hide","avg2_985"],["obj","qstory_main_06_023",0,null,null],["w",1.0],["se","se_306"],["say","Gen-3 Plant Warrior","Zzzzz...",0,""],["objx"],["w",1.5],["chd",0,3,"avg2_985","a","007",null],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,"symbol",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Is it ... asleep?",0,""],["chd",1,3,"avg2_985","a","002",null],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,0.8],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","021",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We call them \"Intelligent,\" but they act on the mind of their \"nutrient.\" They've picked up Nyx's habits, including the afternoon nap.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.9],["bg","story_main_06_017_b",5,0.0],["cbg",5,null,0.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",5,null,50.0,null,"Linear",5.0,null,null,null],["stage",5,0,0],["se","se_055"],["w",1.5],["stage",5,1,7],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_134","a","004",0.2,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,180.0,-50.0,1.2,"OutQuad",0.6,null,null,null],["se","se_072"],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,"2TiaoYue","OutSine",0.7],["w",0.7],["say","avg3_134","Lady Darcia, ==SEX12== Tyrant. Quick count on the three hundred units guarding the lab: two-thirds are out cold, the rest are dozing off. Combat effectiveness is zero.",0,""],["w",0.3],["show","avg2_985","a","007",null,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutSine",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","I... I had no idea...==W== My apologies, Your Majesty! I failed to predict how the upgrade would alter their behavior.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Gen-3 is powerful, but arrogance creates blind spots.==W== Darcia, we need a tactic to force a surrender.",1,""],["w",0.3],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Surrender...==W== I see. You want them for the Tyrant Army. Though, honestly, human soldiers are worthless compared to the plants.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","It's not about manpower. It's a display of strength to the other companies. Mercy requires far more power than annihilation.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","004",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We also need to control the narrative. This isn't a Tyrant Army invasion. It's an internal dispute between Philae Branch and HQ. This version protects us.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","If Nova hears the Tyrant declared war, our list of enemies will grow exponentially.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Your foresight is awe-inspiring, Your Majesty. But ...==W== there is one thing I don't understand...",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["say","avg2_985","You spared New Star Guild for old time's sake.==W== You treat the branch staff well to keep the peace.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","But why show mercy to the enemy? If HQ were winning, they wouldn't hesitate to crush us.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","No one is born evil. Those soldiers are just ordinary people, moved by the Senate's hand.",1,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_100","Besides, these Plants have infinite potential. That is why we must use this power for good—==W==to make the world a little better.",1,""],["w",0.3],["mrt",0,"z","013","star",null],["goon"],["ctl","avg2_985","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Ruling by brute force, like United Harvest, earns no respect or loyalty.",1,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Technically, I'm manipulating Darcia to buy us time for a counterattack... But I meant every word I just said.",2,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"y","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I still don't know why Darcia worships the \"Legendary Tyrant.\" But if I can figure out the root of that faith...",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_077"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,-0.3,1.35,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","009","vexation",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","F-forgive me. I lost my composure and spoke out of turn...",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_075"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","No matter what comes, I pledge my life to you, Your Majesty. Just ...==W== pardon my rudeness, but I find myself quite exhausted. May I take my leave?",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,-0.06,1.1,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",0.6],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Of course. You've worked hard. Go get some rest.==W== Since I have Mina here, I'll send Firenze out tomorrow to field-test the Gen-3 Intelligent Plants. That work for you?",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","004",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg2_985","Thank you for your kindness.",0,""],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.48,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_110","c","014",0.32,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_134","a","011",0.68,-0.06,1.1,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm","m12"],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.9],["stg",0,150.0,null,1.15,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["se","se_055"],["say","avg1_110","...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.9],["stg",0,-100.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["w",1.0],["se","se_055"],["say","avg3_134","...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutQuad",0.7,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["mrt",1,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Hm? Darcia's finally gone, and thanks to Nyx, the plants are sound asleep. Why is everyone still quiet?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,0.5,-0.08,1.1,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Apologies.==W== Your words ... struck a chord. Anyway. What's the mission?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Protect Mistique. And climb the Monolith.",1,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Darcia's ambitions aren't our only problem. The three legions from HQ are acting suspiciously, too.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","009","speechless",null],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_100","I'm raiding the Trekker Camp at dawn. I'll minimize casualties,==W== but I can't control every single plant. Mistique is badly hurt; getting her out safely will be tricky. I'm trusting you to handle it.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","That part I get. But why climb the Monolith?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","019","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Heh. Being the Boss of the Boss Accord has its privileges. Or rather...==W== Let's just say I've unlocked a new authority.",1,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_257"],["mrt",0,"z","004",null,"jushou"],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","013",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","004","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","You know how the Monolith grants Trekkers extra Grace? Big combat boost, but only while they're inside.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Naturally. But that power vanishes the moment you step out, so I never gave it much thought.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","True, but you're my employee now. What if I told you==W== that you could keep that power for a full day outside?",1,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",0,"z","014","music","jushou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_072"],["se","se_368"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","013",null,null,0.05,0.95,1.0,"buman","OutSine",1.0],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.25,"Linear",0.6,null,null,"1ZhenDong"],["w",1],["se","se_070"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","012",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"OutSine",0.8,null,null,null],["say","avg1_110","Boss, do you realize what you're saying? That...==W== That would overturn the whole Trekker industry. No—it would change Nova itself.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,-0.3,1.35,null,"jushou","OutQuad",0.5],["w",1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Exactly. If word gets out, the world will descend into chaos. So...==W== Let's keep this between us.",1,""],["w",0.4],["mrt",0,"z","012",null,"diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","I've updated Petal Bloom and New Star via Heartlink. Firenze, meet New Star on the lake island tomorrow afternoon. You'll climb with them.",1,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Power up inside. Then, early on the 8th, we strike from both sides—hit Darcia, grab the key, and end all this.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Wringing every drop of utility out of me...==W== Fascinating scheme. Very well. I'll play my part.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,-0.12,1.15,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","003","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["bgm","m47"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014","love",null],["say","avg3_100","Appreciated. Just don't overdo it.==W== I'm counting on you to scout our infiltration route for tomorrow night.",1,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","004","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","Save the sentimentality, Boss.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","012",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_110","We're in a match with no retreat. As a player of this match, you should be ready to sacrifice a pawn like me if it secures the win. See you later.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002",null,0.55,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["w",1.5],["mrt",1,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","If you're on board, maybe drop the aggressive attitude...==W== Now, Mina. What are you doing here? Shouldn't you be home watching your sisters?",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","023",null,null],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","attention",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_134","a","012",null,0.52,-0.06,1.1,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_134","I got worried... Came to check on everyone. But on the way, Mistique messaged me... She's in trouble. I-I found Firenze, and she said Mistique was shot down.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_134","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_134","Part of me wants to run back to my sisters, but...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_134","a","011","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-20.0,1.15,"OutSine",0.5,null,null,null],["se","se_169"],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,1],["bg","uniseed_greenhouse_inside_night",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_135","a","017",null,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_135","So...==W== If you really want to protect something, the choice is yours. Do you bury the truth in exchange for peace?==W== Or do you face it head-on, even if it means hurting others?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_135","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["show","avg3_134","a","011",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_134","I...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutSine",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,0,true,false,0.7],["w",0.7],["show","avg3_134","a","006",null,null,null,0,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,1],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,0.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutSine",2.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.7],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a","013",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_134","I'm not a witch or a Trekker. I can't put my life on the line like you do. But...==W== I am a United Harvest staff member. This involves me too.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_134","a","004","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_134","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_134","I may not be a hero...==W== But I want to protect this company in my own way. When I see Mistique, I want to look her in the eye and say I faced the truth—and this is my answer.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_134","a","003","star",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Heh... I get it. I see your resolve—your justice.==W== But the danger is real. Stay close; I don't trust Darcia not to try something if you're alone.",1,""],["w",0.3],["mrt",0,"z","017",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_134","a","008","flower",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_134","R-Right! Thank you, Boss!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.8],["w",0.8],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["bg","uniseed_basement_corelab",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm",""],["head","08:00, Messis Month 7th, Greenhouse District, Philae, Lab Core"],["show","avg2_985","a","002",0.45,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Your Majesty. Our forces are prepared to commence the assault on your order.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.7],["say","avg2_985","Firenze has also taken a position at the Trekker Camp perimeter to monitor the Plants.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.7],["w",0.7],["bg","forest",0,0.0],["bg","forest",6,0.0],["cbg",6,null,200.0,1.35,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_110","c","002",-0.2,0.4,0.9,6,null,null],["show","avg3_1260","a","002",0.8,-0.2,null,6,null,null],["show","avg3_1263","a","002",0.35,0.05,0.9,6,null,null],["show","avg3_1268","a","002",0.65,0.15,null,6,null,null],["show","avg3_1269","a","002",0.13,null,1.1,6,null,null],["film",0],["ctl","avg3_1260","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"youzaiLp","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_1263","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"youzaiLp","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_1268","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"manbu","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_1269","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"manbu","Linear",